.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
**/google-services.json
**/firebase-service-account*.json
**/AuthKey_*.p8

# Claude Code local state: settings.local.json is a machine-specific permission
# allowlist, and launch.json points at per-session scratch directories. Neither
# means anything on another machine.
.claude/

# Editor swap and backup files. One of these was committed once already - a vim swap
# file for an appsettings.json, from a machine and a project name that no longer exist.
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Editor/scratch backups - one of these was committed twice by accident.
*.bak

# License signing key material and issued licenses, anywhere in the tree. core/.gitignore
# already covers core/, but the licensing GUI writes wherever its folder picker last pointed,
# and a private key or a customer's .lic landing one directory higher must not become
# committable just because it missed that file's scope.
*.pem
*.lic

# Android release signing. The upload keystore and the properties file holding its passwords
# never belong in the repo - see docs/STORE_DISTRIBUTION.md for where they live.
android/keystore.properties
android/*.jks
android/*.keystore
android/app/*.jks
android/app/*.keystore

# Google Play Developer API service-account key (lives outside the repo, but belt and braces).
**/play-publisher*.json

# Release output: TestFlight archives (ios/scripts/release.sh, appletv/scripts/release.sh) and
# the self-contained Windows build (windows/publish.ps1). Rebuilt from source every time.
ios/build/
appletv/build/
windows/publish/

__pycache__/

# Demo-video working folder: a demo server's runtime data (databases, keys, logs) and rendered takes
/video/
